Question — Count Commas in Range
Given two integers n and m, count the total number of commas that appear when writing all integers from n to m in decimal notation.
Example:
1000 → 1,000 → 1 comma
1000000 → 1,000,000 → 2 commas
Pattern
Range Counting / Digit Counting
Algorithm
Solution 1 — Brute Force
n se m tak har number check karo.
Us number mein kitne commas honge, calculate karo.
Sabko add kar do.
Solution 2 — Mathematical Counting
Range ko digit-length ke according divide karo.
1000–999999 ke har number mein 1 comma.
1000000–999999999 ke har number mein 2 commas.
Isi tarah required ranges ka contribution add karo.